BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rec Hub DIY
DTSTART:20260711T140000Z
DTEND:20260711T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260709T085752Z
UID:31f5be1c-df77-55fd-9e16-33e1f33da0e3
DESCRIPTION:(https://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub)\n\nThe Cycle Toronto Rec Hub 
 at Evergreen Brick Works is a welcoming community space that takes the int
 imidation out of bike maintenance and repair.\n\nIF YOU'RE ALREADY A TRAIN
 ED CYCLE TORONTO REC HUB VOLUNTEER\, SIGN UP FOR SUPPORT SHIFTS.\n\nOur fr
 iendly staff and volunteers will help guide you through the basics to keep
  you rolling. Even expert home mechanics are also welcome to use our facil
 ities.\n\nDIY service is first come\, first serve.\n\nFind out more: (http
 s://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub) cycleto.ca/rec_hub\nURL: https://www.cycleto.c
 a/rec_hub_diy_20260711
LOCATION:Rec Hub at Evergreen Brick Works\n550 Bayview Avenue\nToronto ON 
 M4W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub_diy_20260711
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FIFA Bike Valet
DTSTART:20260714T163000Z
DTEND:20260715T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260709T085751Z
UID:3885ce9e-8ecf-5b87-8f6c-13c96360b00c
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that football fans can take advantage of FREE bik
 e parking with Cycle Toronto Bike Valet? Skip the traffic and bike with pe
 ace of mind!\n\nBike Valet opens one hour before and closes one hour after
  gates (subject to change).\n\nAll Fan Festival days (June 10 until July 1
 9):\n\n* Inukshuk (789 Lake Shore Blvd W\, Toronto)\n\nMatch days (June 12
 \, June 17\, June 20\, June 23\, June 26\, July 2):\n\n* Inukshuk (789 Lak
 e Shore Blvd W\, Toronto)\n* Hanna (15 Hanna Ave\, Toronto)\n* Ordnance (8
 01 Wellington St W\, Toronto)\n\nFind out more: (https://torontofwc26.ca/g
 etting-around) torontofwc26.ca/getting-around\n\nFAQ What does it cost?\n\
 nCycle Toronto Bike Valet is free! But if you appreciate the service\, con
 sider (https://www.cycleto.ca/join) becoming a member to support our work.
 \n\nCan I leave my helmet and bag?\n\nYes\, we can keep it all with your b
 ike.\n\nDo I need a lock?\n\nNo\, your bike is kept under the watchful eye
 s of our attendants in our secure perimeter.\n\nHow can I get Bike Valet f
 or my event?\n\nContact us: (https://www.cycleto.ca/bikevalet) cycleto.ca/
 bikevalet\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/fifa_bike_valet_20260714
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/fifa_bike_valet_20260714
END:VEVENT
