BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bike Match Drop-Off at Sorauren Farmers' Market
DTSTART:20260713T190000Z
DTEND:20260713T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260709T085749Z
UID:e0183686-f0a7-58fe-ae89-d5d159cade70
DESCRIPTION:Cycle Toronto is collecting bike donations at the Sorauren Far
 mers' Market on Monday\, July 13 from 3:00 PM - 6:30 PM.\n\nAll donated bi
 kes go toward our Bike Match program\, which was founded by Women's Cyclin
 g Network and aims to increase access to cycling across the city while giv
 ing donated bikes a second life.\n\nCycle Toronto and our partner bike hub
 s collect donated bicycles\, repair them\, and provide them to community m
 embers in need. Interested participants can sign up through the (https://b
 ikematchwcn.com/) Bike Match website.\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_ma
 tch_20260713
LOCATION:Sorauren Farmers' Market\n50 Wabash Ave\nToronto ON M6R 1N2\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_match_20260713
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Engagement Station - Leslieville Farmers' Market
DTSTART:20260712T130000Z
DTEND:20260712T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260709T085749Z
UID:f2a700cc-281b-5d6c-ae7b-4da018da643a
DESCRIPTION:We are hosting a Bike Engagement Station at Leslieville Farmer
 s' Market on Sunday\, July 12. We'll be there with some educational materi
 als and will demonstrate how to perform safety checks for those who may no
 t have access to a bike shop but want to get riding. We'll be able to help
  with things like inflating your tires\, lubricating your chain\, demonstr
 ating how to do an (https://www.cycleto.ca/abccheck) ABC safety check\, an
 d anything else our teams can safely accomplish in a few minutes.\n\nSee t
 he details below:\n\n* Date: Sunday\, July 12\, 2026\n* Time: 9:00 am - 2:
 00 pm\n* Location: 150 Greenwood Ave\, Toronto\, ON M4L 1Y5 (Greenwood Par
 k)\n\nBike Month is a month long celebration of cycling across Toronto. Jo
 in us on community rides\, learn more about the joys of cycling or visit o
 ne of our bike engagement stations. Visit (https://www.cycleto.ca/toronto.
 ca/bikemonth) toronto.ca/bikemonth.\n\nSee you there!\nURL: https://www.cy
 cleto.ca/engagement_station_willowdale_summer_environment_day_20260712
LOCATION:Greenwood Park\n150 Greenwood Ave\nToronto ON M4L 1Y5\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/engagement_station_willowdale_summer_environmen
 t_day_20260712
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Engagement Station - Willowdale Summer Environment Day 2026
DTSTART:20260711T140000Z
DTEND:20260711T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260709T085749Z
UID:f4332e51-7476-5547-b845-94099f65e0f8
DESCRIPTION:We are hosting a Bike Engagement Station at Willowdale Summer 
 Environment Day on Saturday\, July 11. We'll be there with some educationa
 l materials and will demonstrate how to perform safety checks for those wh
 o may not have access to a bike shop but want to get riding. We'll be able
  to help with things like inflating your tires\, lubricating your chain\, 
 demonstrating how to do an (https://www.cycleto.ca/abccheck) ABC safety ch
 eck\, and anything else our teams can safely accomplish in a few minutes.\
 n\nSee the details below:\n\n* Date: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\n* Time: 10
 :00 am - 2:00 pm\n* Location: 6464 Yonge St\, North York M2M 3X4 (Center P
 oint Mall Parking Lot)\n\nBike Month is a month long celebration of cyclin
 g across Toronto. Join us on community rides\, learn more about the joys o
 f cycling or visit one of our bike engagement stations. Visit (https://www
 .cycleto.ca/toronto.ca/bikemonth) toronto.ca/bikemonth.\n\nSee you there!\
 nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/engagement_station_willowdale_summer_environm
 ent_day_20260711
LOCATION:Centrepoint Mall North Parking Lot\n6464 Yonge St\nNorth York ON 
 M2M 3X4\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/engagement_station_willowdale_summer_environmen
 t_day_20260711
END:VEVENT
